braam::zlib is a C++ rewrite of zlib 1.3.2.1, altered from the original: the
algorithms of deflate.c, trees.c, inflate.c, inffast.c, inftrees.c, crc32.c,
adler32.c, compress.c and uncompr.c, translated to C++ over the Braam kernel's
heap and types, with the gz* file functions left out. It is not the original
software.

The original's notice follows, unaltered.

